MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 ArrayLoopAssign_TestArrayLoop
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 3 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 )
END

ArrayLoopAssign_TestArrayLoop [ 1 ]
BEGIN

MOVE TEMP 1 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE  TIMES  PLUS 5 1  4
MOVE TEMP 4 4
L2 CJUMP  LE TEMP 4 MINUS  TIMES  PLUS 5 1  4  1 L3
HSTORE  PLUS TEMP 3 TEMP 4 0  0
MOVE TEMP 4 PLUS TEMP 4 4
JUMP L2
L3 HSTORE TEMP 3 0 5
RETURN TEMP 3
END


MOVE TEMP 2 0
L4	CJUMP LE TEMP 2 4 L6
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 2 4 L5

L5	
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 TEMP 2 4 TIMES TEMP 2 TEMP 2


MOVE TEMP 2 PLUS TEMP 2 1


JUMP L4
L6	NOOP

MOVE TEMP 2 0
L7	CJUMP LE TEMP 2 4 L9
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 2 4 L8

L8	
PRINT BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 TEMP 2
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 5 4
RETURN TEMP 6
END



MOVE TEMP 2 PLUS TEMP 2 1


JUMP L7
L9	NOOP

RETURN 0
END

